# OpenAPI contracts

Each module API owns `contract/swagger.yaml`. UI consumes APIs only through `@namma-medmate/api-client`.

After swagger edits: `pnpm codegen` then `pnpm exec nx run contracts:check`. Never hand-edit `libs/*/src/generated`.

Envelope: `{ data }` success; `{ error: { code, message, i18n_key } }` failure.

```yaml
# GOOD — module-owned path
# modules/auth/api/contract/swagger.yaml
paths:
  /auth/session:
    get:
      operationId: getAuthSession
```

Keep `implemented-routes.json` in sync with controllers (skill `api-contract-tester`).
